\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces M3 federated and differential-privacy sweep, per-seed evidence. (a) Paired per-seed federation cost on mean reward per step, same 10 seeds. Centralised scores higher on 2 seeds, federated on 3, 5 ties, no measurable difference (Wilcoxon $p=0.8125$). (b) Privacy-utility curve using block precision against the DP noise multiplier $\sigma $, individual seed values (light dots) behind the mean, with the seed count that ever blocked anything at each $\sigma $ printed below (precision is undefined otherwise). Precision is perfect through $\sigma =1.0$, dropping sharply by $\sigma =4.0$.}}{12}{figure.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:m3-privacy}{{4}{12}{M3 federated and differential-privacy sweep, per-seed evidence. (a) Paired per-seed federation cost on mean reward per step, same 10 seeds. Centralised scores higher on 2 seeds, federated on 3, 5 ties, no measurable difference (Wilcoxon $p=0.8125$). (b) Privacy-utility curve using block precision against the DP noise multiplier $\sigma $, individual seed values (light dots) behind the mean, with the seed count that ever blocked anything at each $\sigma $ printed below (precision is undefined otherwise). Precision is perfect through $\sigma =1.0$, dropping sharply by $\sigma =4.0$}{figure.4}{}}
